    "Name": "Mantis MTS-T",
    "Details": "Debuting in 3052, the Mantis is a light mech designed for the Mech arenas on Solaris VII. A 30-ton Mech, the Mantis is powered by a 270-rated XL Engine, giving it the speed to outrun or out-maneuver almost any other Mech. The Mantis MTS-T is armed with 3 ER Medium Lasers and a pair of ER Small Lasers augmented by a Targeting Computer. MASC and a pair of Claws allow it to tear apart other Mechs. \n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Battle Fists</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.99</color></b>",
